  "description": "The year is 2030, and humanity is in its golden age of space exploration. Ju-Myeong is just your average high school student, but after Betelgeuse, a supergiant star, explodes in the sky, he starts noticing that things are not quite as they seem. A.I. starts acting strange, technology doesn’t work, and people’s memories are scrambled. Even Soh, his reclusive classmate, seems to have inhuman capabilities. Does she hold the answers to the mysteries of their school… and their world?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61368814), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B2%A0%ED%85%94%EA%B2%8C%EC%9A%B0%EC%8A%A4/3639)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[English](https://tapas.io/series/betelgeuse/info), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/175290)",
